---
title: "liquidity mining reward tracking (Current Finance: LiquidityMiner)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_support: support_coin(MarketType, CoinType)
    q_support --> q_create: create RewardManager for (CoinType, reward_type)
    q_create --> q_active: mining active

    q_active --> q_update: update_obligation_reward_manager(reward_type, obligation_id, balance, clock)
    q_update --> q_get_manager: load RewardManager for (CoinType, reward_type)
    q_get_manager --> q_calc_pending: calculate pending rewards based on balance change
    q_calc_pending --> q_store_pending: store updated reward state
    q_store_pending --> [*]

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: Two reward types: deposit (ctoken balance) and borrow (debt floor)
        INV-002: Rewards updated on every deposit, withdraw, borrow, repay, liquidation
        INV-003: Reward calculation uses obligation's balance at time of update
        INV-004: Mining parameters configurable by admin
    end note
